1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,500
Mist drifts through a lush forest of massive trees. A tall bird with sweeping crest feathers stands motionless.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,500
A brilliant streak of light descends through the hazy canopy.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:11,000
The bird turns its head to watch the landing craft fall. Glowing motes float gently in the damp air as the ship vanishes behind the distant trees.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,693
Darkness.
